  "summary": "My career has revolved around creating solutions to make others in the organization more effective in their jobs through technology. A life-long technophile, I have a strong track record of success in every facet of software delivery - including the design and development of applications, the infrastructure that enables them to run, and the leadership of teams that can replicate my experience at scale. Any of those areas could by themselves be the reason I get out of bed in the morning - a position that incorporates all of them is my dream.\n\n• Success with developing effective enterprise applications led to creation of a custom-made management position to capitalize on my background\n• Experience in quickly taking a brand-new agile development team from creation to shipping\n• Strong C# .NET developer with 10+ years of full-stack enterprise application development \n• Effective communicator across all levels and functions",
